      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Bala hosted Kansas’s first county cheese factory in 1876, where James Sharpless also ran a general store and the town’s dairy industry thrived.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        7,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
